  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tsangano Organic Coffee Capacity Building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be focused on capacity building; and providing financial and farmer training to improve TOCA s management capacities while empowering its members with improved organic farming skills and preparing the association to obtain organic certification and implement a revolving loan fund to provide members access to higher quality inputs and tools.</narrative>
  </description>
